From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:37:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: rockchip-vop: add RK3308 VOP

The RK3308 has a single "VOP lite" display controller with a parallel
RGB output. Add a compatible for it.

Signed-off-by: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop.yaml       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop.yaml
index fdf4b1109..5dab85fc8 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/rockchip/rockchip-vop.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ properties:
       - rockchip,rk3188-vop
       - rockchip,rk3228-vop
       - rockchip,rk3288-vop
+      - rockchip,rk3308-vop
       - rockchip,rk3328-vop
       - rockchip,rk3366-vop
       - rockchip,rk3368-vop
